# Friend Ledger — Local Android Keystore Configuration Template
# DO NOT COMMIT ACTUAL PASSWORDS OR KEYSTORES TO VERSION CONTROL
#
# Steps:
# 1. Export your existing EAS credentials:
#    eas credentials -p android
#    Select your build profile -> "Keystore: Manage your Android Keystore" -> "Download keystore"
# 2. Place the downloaded keystore in mobile/android/release.keystore
# 3. Copy this file to mobile/android/keystore.properties (which is gitignored)
# 4. Fill in the values below:
#
# storeFile=release.keystore
# storePassword=YOUR_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD
# keyAlias=YOUR_KEY_ALIAS
# keyPassword=YOUR_KEY_PASSWORD
